# 🔥 Meengle Subscription Tiers

## Tier Structure

Meengle uses a **5-tier subscription model**:

### 1. **FREE** 🆓
- **Price**: $0/month
- **Features**:
  - Basic profile
  - View matches
  - Send messages (limited)
  - Basic profile browsing
  - Limited filtering

---

### 2. **SPARK** ✨
- **Price**: $4.99/month
- **Features**:
  - ✨ Spark profile badge
  - Extended match suggestions
  - More messages per day
  - Basic advanced filters
  - Standard support
  - **Entry-level premium experience**

---

### 3. **SPARK+** ⭐
- **Price**: $9.99/month
- **Features**:
  - ⭐ Spark+ profile badge (premium)
  - Unlimited matches
  - Unlimited messaging
  - Advanced filtering options
  - Rewind feature (undo last action)
  - Priority customer support
  - **Most popular tier**

---

### 4. **FLAME** 🔥
- **Price**: $14.99/month
- **Features**:
  - 🔥 Flame profile badge (elite)
  - All Spark+ features
  - Video calling capabilities
  - Exclusive match recommendations
  - Premium advanced filters
  - Dedicated support team
  - Profile boost weekly
  - **Premium experience**

---

### 5. **WILDFIRE** 🌪️
- **Price**: $24.99/month
- **Features**:
  - 🌪️ Wildfire VIP badge (legendary)
  - All Flame features
  - Unlimited video calls
  - VIP-only events access
  - Priority matching algorithm
  - Concierge support (24/7)
  - Exclusive perks & bonuses
  - Monthly profile highlighting
  - **Top-tier luxury experience**

---

